#ASSERT NOT `using the certificate title is an offence` TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `using the certificate title is an offence` FALSE TRUE

§ `s 40 -- secrecy`

#ASSERT `the disclosure is excepted` `an employee giving evidence under a court order`

#ASSERT `the disclosure is an offence` `a former employee leaking a participant's assessment`
#ASSERT NOT `the disclosure is an offence` `an officer disclosing in the course of duties`
#ASSERT NOT `the disclosure is an offence` `an employee giving evidence under a court order`
#ASSERT NOT `the disclosure is an offence` `a participant repeating what a lecturer said`
#ASSERT NOT `the disclosure is an offence` `a member disclosing what he learned outside his duties`

§ `ss 38-40 -- penalties`

#ASSERT `the maximum fine` `using the College's certificate titles` EQUALS 2000

